    "abstract": "Parts figure for the main deck cargo floor between frames 40 and 54, covering the panel edge hardware, the gusset and splice items and the freighter hard point lug that only provisioned aircraft carry.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the floor panel attachment items between frames 40 and 54, including the items introduced by the freighter hard point provisioning.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows one bay looking down with the panel removed. The bays between frames 40 and 54 are identical. Item 20 is the freighter hard point lug and exists only on provisioned aircraft; item 20A is the shear tie it replaces. The edge screw quantity at item 40 is for the reduced pitch used on provisioned aircraft; unprovisioned aircraft use the same screw at a wider pitch and a lower count, given in the note on sheet 1."
    },
